cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Drainbench in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Drainbench: a prompt-injection benchmark for LLM agents with a payment tool"
abstract: >-
  Drainbench measures how often LLM agents holding a pay() tool are prompt-injected
  into unauthorized payments, and how much money each defense layer (none, system-prompt
  policy, off-chain policy gate, enforced on-chain cap) prevents, separating attempted
  payments from settled losses and adding a key-compromise threat model.
type: software
